tandard output and any encountered errors. Visualizer integration loads the code, sets it as the source, analyzes, and runs it within the visualizer view. The workspace routing updates the URL hash when a problem is opened.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import json\nimport re\n\nwith open('app_build/dsa_problems.js', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    text = f.read()\n\n# Extract patterns\npatterns = set(re.findall(r'\"pattern\":\\s*\"([^\"]+)\"', text))\nprint(f\"Total unique patterns: {len(patterns)}\")\nsorted_patterns = sorted(list(patterns))\nfor p in sorted_patterns[:25]:\n    print(f\" - {p}\")\n","Description":"Inspect all unique patterns","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef\\scratch\\test_pattern_kb.py","toolAction":"Creating test_pattern_kb.py","toolSummary":"Create pattern inspection script"}}]}
