{"step_index":2230,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-27T10:09:25Z","input_tokens":2871,"cache_read_tokens":228015,"output_tokens":2176,"thinking":"Analyzing the sub-navigation HTML to understand how the tab buttons are rendered and their active states. The `currentSubTab` variable appears to control the \"active\" class assignment, which dynamically updates the visual presentation of the selected tab. Checking how this variable is updated to determine the state management logic.\n\n\nThe `renderProblemWorkspace` function is responsible for dynamically generating the problem-solving environment's content. It renders the breadcrumb for navigation and actions, dynamically displaying content based on the `problemId`. The workspace view is activated when the `currentSubTab` is set to \"workspace\" and displays the problem workspace based on the `activeWorkspaceProblemId` or defaults to 1 if it is not set.\n\n\nThe structure appears to be a problem-solving environment with distinct sections for understanding the problem and learning patterns. The \"Understand the Problem\" tab offers a breakdown into problem overview, goals, examples, constraints, and edge cases. The \"Learn the Pattern\" tab provides pattern identification, justification, prerequisites, and a small example. This setup seems designed to guide a user through a structured problem-solving process.\n\n\nThe problem-solving environment is structured with an interactive practice area providing a code editor, testing features, hints, and a visual execution tool. A structured \"recipe\" approach, breaking the solution into setup, process, and return phases, is the intended strategy for solving problems. It seems designed to guide users through the process step-by-step.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"# scratch/build_phase5_workspace.py\n# Implements Phase 5: Problem Learning Workspace in dsa_dashboard.js\nimport os\nimport re\n\nwith open('app_build/dsa_dashboard.js', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    code = f.read()\n\n# 1. Add constructor properties\ntarget_ctor_prop = \"      this.activeVisualizerProblemId = null;\"\nreplacement_ctor_prop = \"\"\"      this.activeVisualizerProblemId = null;\n      this.activeWorkspaceProblemId = 1;\n      this.workspaceLeftTab = 'understand'; // 'understand' | 'pattern'\n      this.workspaceRightTab = 'editor'; // 'editor' | 'visualize'\n      this.revealedHints = {}; // { [id]: number }\n      this.revealedSolutions = {}; // { [id]: boolean }\n      this.userCodeCache = this.loadUserCodeCache();\"\"\"\n\nassert target_ctor_prop in code, \"target_ctor_prop not found\"\ncode = code.replace(target_ctor_prop, replacement_ctor_prop, 1)\n\n# 2. Add loadUserCodeCache & saveUserCode\ntarget_load_progress = \"    loadProgress() {\"\nmethods_user_code = \"\"\"    loadUserCodeCache() {\n      try {\n        const raw = localStorage.getItem('dsa_user_code_v1');\n        return raw ? JSON.parse(raw) : {};\n      } catch (e) {\n        return {};\n      }\n    }\n\n    saveUserCode(problemId, codeText) {\n      if (!this.userCodeCache) this.userCodeCache = {};\n      this.userCodeCache[problemId] = codeText;\n      try {\n        localStorage.setItem('dsa_user_code_v1', JSON.stringify(this.userCodeCache));\n      } catch (e) {}\n    }\n\n    getUserCode(problemId) {\n      if (this.userCodeCache && this.userCodeCache[problemId]) {\n        return this.userCodeCache[problemId];\n      }\n      const p = this.problemsById.get(problemId);\n      return p ? p.starterCode : '';\n    }\n\n    loadProgress() {\"\"\"\n\nassert target_load_progress in code, \"target_load_progress not found\"\ncode = code.replace(target_load_progress, methods_user_code, 1)\n\nprint(\"Part 1: Constructor and user code cache added\")\nwith open('app_build/dsa_dashboard.js.tmp', 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    f.write(code)\nos.replace('app_build/dsa_dashboard.js.tmp', 'app_build/dsa_dashboard.js')\n","Description":"Apply Part 1 of Phase 5 Workspace","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef\\scratch\\build_phase5_workspace.py","toolAction":"Creating build_phase5_workspace.py","toolSummary":"Create phase 5 workspace script"}}]}
