{"step_index":2234,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-27T10:10:02Z","input_tokens":2312,"cache_read_tokens":231179,"output_tokens":2240,"thinking":"Setting the active problem ID and workspace tabs to initialize the problem environment. The previous problem ID is stored for later access, and a history entry is added to track the user's progress. Finally, the route is updated, the view is rendered, and the page scrolls to the top for a smooth user experience.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"# scratch/build_phase5_workspace_part2.py\nimport os\n\nwith open('app_build/dsa_dashboard.js', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    code = f.read()\n\n# 1. Update subnav and render() to include Workspace view\ntarget_subnav = \"\"\"            <!-- Sub-Navigation Pills -->\n            <div class=\"dsa-subnav\" role=\"tablist\">\n              <button class=\"dsa-tab-btn ${this.currentSubTab === 'dashboard' ? 'active' : ''}\" data-dsa-tab=\"dashboard\">\n                📊 Dashboard\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"dsa-tab-btn ${this.currentSubTab === 'topics' || this.currentSubTab === 'topic_detail' ? 'active' : ''}\" data-dsa-tab=\"topics\">\n                📚 Topic Library (30 Topics)\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"dsa-tab-btn ${this.currentSubTab === 'problems' ? 'active' : ''}\" data-dsa-tab=\"problems\">\n                📋 Problem Library (300)\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"dsa-tab-btn ${this.currentSubTab === 'roadmap' ? 'active' : ''}\" data-dsa-tab=\"roadmap\">\n                🗺️ Beginner Roadmap (8 Phases)\n              </button>\n            </div>\"\"\"\n\nreplacement_subnav = \"\"\"            <!-- Sub-Navigation Pills -->\n            <div class=\"dsa-subnav\" role=\"tablist\">\n              <button class=\"dsa-tab-btn ${this.currentSubTab === 'dashboard' ? 'active' : ''}\" data-dsa-tab=\"dashboard\">\n            